# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Binary design assets. `binary` is git's built-in macro for `-text -diff`: never line-ending
# normalised on check-in or checkout, and never diffed as text. These rules are explicit rather
# than left to git's content heuristic, which is a guess and can be wrong on a small file.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.bmp binary

# SVG is genuine text (XML), so it is normalised and diffed like any other source file.
*.svg text
